About this file
---------------

Yices itself is covered by the terms in the file LICENSE, which accompanies
this file in every Yices distribution.

This file is separate from LICENSE. It describes third-party material that
Yices includes, or that is combined with Yices when Yices is built and
distributed. For each component it records what the component is and where it
came from. It records the terms under which that component's own authors
distribute it where the repository evidence establishes them, and records the
gap where it does not.

This file identifies third-party components distributed with Yices and
reproduces notices provided by those components. It does not modify or replace
any applicable license term. It does not state terms for any combined work,
and nothing in it should be read as doing so.

Three collections of files are described, and they are not the same. Some
components appear in all three, some in only one.

  Section 1  Third-party material inside the Yices source code itself.
             Present in the source repository, the source distribution, and
             every binary distribution.

  Section 2  Additional third-party files carried in the Yices source
             distribution and source repository. Mostly build and
             documentation tooling. With one exception these are not part of
             any binary distribution.

  Section 3  Components incorporated into the Yices binary distributions
             when Yices is compiled and linked.

Section 4 lists the license texts that accompany this file in the source
distribution and in the binary archives. The relink kits carry a licenses
directory, spelled in lower case, that holds a subset of that list, and the
subset differs between platforms. Section 5 says which component versions are
fixed for this release and where to find the ones that depend on the build
machine. Section 6 covers the material published for rebuilding.


